          "text": "Right ankle swelling and bruising"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Lateral ankle swelling and bruising developed within hours of the injury, were worst in the first 48 hours, and are now approximately 50% better."
      }
